flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Patient Selects Doctor]
    B --> C[Patient Selects Date]
    C --> D[Fetch Available Slots]

    D --> E{Is Slot Available?}

    E -- Yes --> F[Book Appointment]
    F --> G[Create Appointment]
    G --> H[Update Slot Status to Unavailable]
    H --> I[Return Success Response]
    I --> Z([End])

    E -- No --> J[Return "Slot Unavailable" Message]
    J --> Z